\[r = c.\](A) Line
(B) Circle
(C) Plane
(D) Sphere
(E) Cylinder
(F) Cone

Enter the letter of the correct option.
Solution: In cylindrical coordinates, $r$ denotes the distance between a point and the $z$-axis.  So if this distance is fixed, then we obtain a cylinder.  The answer is $\boxed{\text{(E)}}.$

